1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 24=

4
00:01:46,700 --> 00:01:49,420
Tomorrow really
is perfect hunting weather.

5
00:01:58,740 --> 00:01:59,980
Please be very careful tomorrow.

6
00:02:04,300 --> 00:02:05,580
Tomorrow isn't even here yet,

7
00:02:06,620 --> 00:02:07,820
and you're already
worrying yourself sick.

8
00:02:09,380 --> 00:02:10,580
Haven't you heard

9
00:02:10,980 --> 00:02:12,260
the saying

10
00:02:12,340 --> 00:02:14,700
that every moment of a night like this
is precious?

11
00:02:17,300 --> 00:02:17,980
Then how about

12
00:02:18,900 --> 00:02:20,060
we save our strength

13
00:02:20,740 --> 00:02:21,460
and get some proper rest?

14
00:02:23,220 --> 00:02:25,020
I am getting proper rest.

15
00:02:31,180 --> 00:02:35,160
♪Playing out life's game,
forever by your side♪

16
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:39,340
♪Innocent years drift gently by♪

17
00:02:39,700 --> 00:02:46,540
♪I thought time might stand still
forever at that crossroads♪

18
00:02:46,540 --> 00:02:48,500
(Who knows what tomorrow will bring?)

19
00:02:50,060 --> 00:02:51,180
(But whatever happens,)

20
00:02:52,220 --> 00:02:54,100
(I must kill Meng Zaishi.)

21
00:02:55,140 --> 00:02:59,660
(Huai)

22
00:03:01,180 --> 00:03:03,620
(Huai)

23
00:03:18,260 --> 00:03:20,020
As expected of your personal guards,
Your Royal Highness.

24
00:03:20,660 --> 00:03:23,140
Quite the killer instinct.

25
00:03:23,940 --> 00:03:24,820
Lord Yu, you flatter me.

26
00:03:25,700 --> 00:03:26,740
How lucky they are

27
00:03:27,260 --> 00:03:29,020
to earn praise from an expert like you.

28
00:03:33,940 --> 00:03:34,820
(Wanyao, I'm sorry.)

29
00:03:35,620 --> 00:03:36,620
(I'm breaking my promise again.)

30
00:03:37,260 --> 00:03:38,740
(I can't hunt that deer for you.)

31
00:03:39,580 --> 00:03:40,380
(Just like)

32
00:03:41,580 --> 00:03:43,140
(I couldn't take you away
from Sheng'an.)

33
00:03:45,420 --> 00:03:47,140
(Huai)

34
00:04:02,940 --> 00:04:04,140
The deer wears a golden bell.

35
00:04:04,340 --> 00:04:05,940
It was released
into the mountains last night.

36
00:04:06,260 --> 00:04:07,300
The gong signals the start.

37
00:04:07,700 --> 00:04:08,980
Teams, enter the mountains.

38
00:04:09,580 --> 00:04:11,100
The deer hunt ends

39
00:04:11,540 --> 00:04:13,300
at sunrise tomorrow.

40
00:04:23,260 --> 00:04:29,060
(Huai)

41
00:04:48,860 --> 00:04:49,180
Go!

42
00:04:52,620 --> 00:04:52,980
Mr. Wei.

43
00:04:53,620 --> 00:04:53,940
Mr. Wei.

44
00:04:54,140 --> 00:04:54,620
Mr. Yan.

45
00:04:56,340 --> 00:04:57,380
Why are you leading your horse?

46
00:04:57,780 --> 00:04:58,780
Did you cram in some riding practice?

47
00:04:59,220 --> 00:05:00,180
Even so,

48
00:05:01,260 --> 00:05:02,540
I doubt you can beat them.

49
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:04,100
I'm not here to hunt the deer.

50
00:05:04,780 --> 00:05:06,300
I'm here to see someone.

51
00:05:07,140 --> 00:05:07,620
Who?

52
00:05:07,820 --> 00:05:08,380
Mu Xianqing.

53
00:05:09,020 --> 00:05:09,980
What do you want with him?

54
00:05:12,500 --> 00:05:13,460
I'm going to talk him

55
00:05:13,780 --> 00:05:16,260
into killing Meng Zaishi
in the chaos out in the mountains.

56
00:05:20,700 --> 00:05:22,060
After all, if he misses this chance,

57
00:05:22,500 --> 00:05:23,300
he'll never get a better shot

58
00:05:23,300 --> 00:05:24,580
at taking the Central Circuit.

59
00:05:27,780 --> 00:05:28,180
Mr. Wei,

60
00:05:29,140 --> 00:05:30,100
this is a big deal.

61
00:05:30,580 --> 00:05:31,260
It stays between us.

62
00:05:32,100 --> 00:05:32,980
If I'm back

63
00:05:33,300 --> 00:05:34,020
in two hours,

64
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:36,020
we'll wait for news
of Meng Zaishi's death.

65
00:05:36,860 --> 00:05:37,540
If I'm not,

66
00:05:38,260 --> 00:05:39,860
that means Mu Xianqing refused me.

67
00:05:40,620 --> 00:05:41,740
And I'm probably done for.

68
00:05:46,060 --> 00:05:46,500
Mr. Yan,

69
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:47,940
since you told me,

70
00:05:48,660 --> 00:05:49,820
you must've made up your mind.

71
00:05:50,980 --> 00:05:52,140
But I still have to ask.

72
00:05:52,860 --> 00:05:53,740
Is this really

73
00:05:54,020 --> 00:05:54,940
what you have to do?

74
00:05:56,740 --> 00:05:57,540
It's not that I have to.

75
00:05:58,340 --> 00:05:59,300
There's no other way.

76
00:06:00,460 --> 00:06:01,260
As for my chances,

77
00:06:02,020 --> 00:06:03,380
whether in Sheng'an or Lingnan,

78
00:06:03,660 --> 00:06:05,100
I've never met anyone my silver tongue

79
00:06:05,580 --> 00:06:06,700
couldn't win over.

80
00:06:08,100 --> 00:06:08,740
Let's hope

81
00:06:09,340 --> 00:06:10,220
this time's the same.

82
00:06:11,260 --> 00:06:11,620
Mr. Wei.

83
00:06:12,500 --> 00:06:12,900
I'm off.

84
00:06:19,460 --> 00:06:19,740
Go!

85
00:06:31,620 --> 00:06:32,580
Your Highness.

86
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:36,380
Forgive me for not getting off
to pay my respects.

87
00:06:40,660 --> 00:06:41,180
Doesn't matter.

88
00:06:42,060 --> 00:06:42,900
Sooner or later,

89
00:06:43,900 --> 00:06:45,460
I'll make you look at me
the way you used to,

90
00:06:46,180 --> 00:06:47,900
with tenderness in your eyes,

91
00:06:49,060 --> 00:06:49,900
begging me.

92
00:06:52,620 --> 00:06:53,500
We'll see.

93
00:06:58,260 --> 00:06:58,700
It'll happen soon.

94
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:27,460
Zhi.

95
00:07:40,940 --> 00:07:41,580
Everyone,

96
00:07:42,300 --> 00:07:43,060
follow this dog

97
00:07:43,860 --> 00:07:44,540
and take it slow.

98
00:07:45,060 --> 00:07:45,860
Don't make a sound.

99
00:07:47,100 --> 00:07:47,500
Zhi.

100
00:07:48,940 --> 00:07:49,260
Track.

101
00:07:57,220 --> 00:07:58,660
(Didn't expect to find him so fast.)

102
00:07:59,500 --> 00:08:00,900
(But what's Mu Xianqing doing here?)

103
00:08:02,180 --> 00:08:03,460
(Looks like he's waiting for someone.)

104
00:08:13,860 --> 00:08:15,700
(Shi, Xun, Yu, Qing)

105
00:08:15,700 --> 00:08:16,660
(Why'd the Crown Prince)

106
00:08:16,660 --> 00:08:17,940
(get involved?)

107
00:08:20,420 --> 00:08:21,980
(He's always kept his abilities hidden)

108
00:08:22,180 --> 00:08:24,260
(and never dared show his strength
before Lord Yu.)

109
00:08:26,420 --> 00:08:27,420
(Why step into the spotlight now?)

110
00:08:28,260 --> 00:08:29,620
(What is he really after?)

111
00:08:29,620 --> 00:08:32,860
(Qing-Xun)

112
00:08:45,860 --> 00:08:46,180
Go!

113
00:08:50,380 --> 00:08:50,820
Come clean.

114
00:08:51,260 --> 00:08:51,820
Did you just stumble in,

115
00:08:52,580 --> 00:08:53,580
or were you spying on purpose?

116
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:56,380
(No wonder the Crown Prince
suddenly made a move.)

117
00:08:57,260 --> 00:08:58,820
(So he's found a new ally.)

118
00:08:59,740 --> 00:09:00,220
Yang Si,

119
00:09:01,260 --> 00:09:02,980
when did the Crown Prince
and Mu Xianqing team up?

120
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:04,780
Before the Qiuqian Banquet or after?

121
00:09:06,980 --> 00:09:07,500
Yan Shang,

122
00:09:07,860 --> 00:09:08,780
you must have a death wish!

123
00:09:09,620 --> 00:09:10,140
Yang Si,

124
00:09:10,940 --> 00:09:12,420
I know what you're planning next.

125
00:09:12,860 --> 00:09:14,900
But please, talk the Crown Prince

126
00:09:15,500 --> 00:09:16,620
out of doing anything rash.

127
00:09:17,180 --> 00:09:19,380
If those two have been scheming together
all along,

128
00:09:20,060 --> 00:09:21,380
Yu Cheng'an probably already knows,

129
00:09:21,500 --> 00:09:23,300
which is why he let them hunt together.

130
00:09:23,860 --> 00:09:25,940
Even I caught the Crown Prince's move

131
00:09:26,260 --> 00:09:27,460
and found it odd.

132
00:09:28,140 --> 00:09:29,620
Yu Cheng'an can't be unaware.

133
00:09:44,380 --> 00:09:45,220
But it's come to this.

134
00:09:45,820 --> 00:09:46,780
Even if we do nothing,

135
00:09:47,500 --> 00:09:48,900
would Yu Cheng'an
ever let His Royal Highness off?

136
00:09:50,460 --> 00:09:51,700
Why not wait and see,

137
00:09:52,020 --> 00:09:52,980
and play defense?

138
00:09:54,020 --> 00:09:55,340
Better than a misstep.

139
00:09:59,100 --> 00:10:00,380
We've already come this far.

140
00:10:01,020 --> 00:10:02,220
Keep playing along,

141
00:10:02,620 --> 00:10:03,580
and we'll only miss our window,

142
00:10:04,340 --> 00:10:05,740
maybe even let Yu Cheng'an steal
the initiative.

143
00:10:05,980 --> 00:10:07,820
Tonight we fight to the death!

144
00:10:07,820 --> 00:10:09,740
But now's not the time.

145
00:10:11,300 --> 00:10:11,940
Trust me.

146
00:10:15,900 --> 00:10:16,300
Okay.

147
00:10:17,940 --> 00:10:18,420
Yan Shang,

148
00:10:19,220 --> 00:10:20,980
you think
we're throwing rocks at a wall?

149
00:10:22,100 --> 00:10:23,860
You underestimate the Crown Prince.

150
00:10:30,340 --> 00:10:31,020
Yan Shang,

151
00:10:31,380 --> 00:10:32,140
don't blame me.

152
00:10:33,340 --> 00:10:34,500
If those two find out,

153
00:10:35,220 --> 00:10:36,300
you're as good as dead.

154
00:10:41,140 --> 00:10:42,420
It's been more than two hours.

155
00:10:42,980 --> 00:10:43,540
What do I do?

156
00:10:48,060 --> 00:10:49,420
(I need to find Miss Zhao for help.)

157
00:10:59,100 --> 00:10:59,580
Yan Shang?

158
00:11:01,620 --> 00:11:02,100
Yan Shang?

159
00:11:03,020 --> 00:11:03,460
Yan Shang!

160
00:11:05,700 --> 00:11:06,140
Yan Shang?

161
00:11:07,500 --> 00:11:07,940
Yan Shang?

162
00:11:08,740 --> 00:11:09,540
Are you okay?

163
00:11:10,460 --> 00:11:11,020
Yan Shang?

164
00:11:14,700 --> 00:11:15,100
Hurry.

165
00:11:15,820 --> 00:11:16,580
Take me
to the temporary imperial palace.

166
00:11:23,420 --> 00:11:30,380
(Temporary Imperial Palace at
the Hunting Grounds, Yuhua Palace, Yu)

167
00:11:31,820 --> 00:11:33,060
(Yu Cheng'an's always)

168
00:11:33,420 --> 00:11:34,420
(Yu)
(heavily guarded wherever he goes.)

169
00:11:35,580 --> 00:11:36,140
(Yet)

170
00:11:37,100 --> 00:11:38,180
(it's so loose here today.)

171
00:11:39,540 --> 00:11:41,580
(Yuhua Palace, Yu.)

172
00:11:41,580 --> 00:11:42,020
Who are you?

173
00:11:45,700 --> 00:11:46,340
I

174
00:11:47,060 --> 00:11:48,620
am a collator at the Hongwen Hall.

175
00:11:49,060 --> 00:11:50,580
I came to the hunting grounds
with my colleagues.

176
00:11:51,260 --> 00:11:51,980
It's truly a rare chance,

177
00:11:52,100 --> 00:11:53,220
so I came to pay my respects to Lord Yu.

178
00:11:53,860 --> 00:11:54,740
Please pass it on.

179
00:11:55,060 --> 00:11:55,340
Get lost!

180
00:11:57,460 --> 00:11:58,940
I've been to Lord Yu's residence.

181
00:11:59,540 --> 00:11:59,860
Really.

182
00:12:01,020 --> 00:12:01,780
Haven't you seen me before?

183
00:12:02,580 --> 00:12:02,940
What about you?

184
00:12:06,740 --> 00:12:08,180
Please, cut me some slack.

185
00:12:15,900 --> 00:12:16,420
Mr. Liu!

186
00:12:17,780 --> 00:12:18,220
Mr. Liu.

187
00:12:20,940 --> 00:12:23,380
(Huai)

188
00:12:26,140 --> 00:12:26,900
I'm here to see Lord Yu.

189
00:12:29,900 --> 00:12:30,860
Lord Yu's tied up.

190
00:12:31,220 --> 00:12:31,780
No visitors.

191
00:12:32,500 --> 00:12:33,180
Sir, please go back.

192
00:12:37,740 --> 00:12:38,940
Please, just give me a chance.

193
00:12:39,140 --> 00:12:40,300
I just need one meeting with Lord Yu.

194
00:12:42,860 --> 00:12:43,740
Please go back.

195
00:12:44,460 --> 00:12:45,620
Lord Yu really isn't seeing anyone.

196
00:12:48,060 --> 00:12:49,300
Why are you here causing trouble?

197
00:12:50,780 --> 00:12:51,260
Don't worry.

198
00:12:51,820 --> 00:12:53,300
That deer was never released.

199
00:12:53,940 --> 00:12:54,860
It's locked in a cage.

200
00:12:55,780 --> 00:12:56,180
Wenji,

201
00:12:56,940 --> 00:12:57,620
what he's really hunting here

202
00:12:58,140 --> 00:12:59,300
is the Crown Prince.

203
00:13:03,340 --> 00:13:03,660
Shang.

204
00:13:04,820 --> 00:13:06,180
This is none of our business.

205
00:13:06,460 --> 00:13:07,620
Stop asking me.

206
00:13:08,340 --> 00:13:09,300
You'll get me killed.

207
00:13:15,700 --> 00:13:16,300
Get out!

208
00:13:16,700 --> 00:13:18,340
A nobody official like you

209
00:13:18,660 --> 00:13:19,500
wants to see Lord Yu?

210
00:13:19,900 --> 00:13:20,220
Out!

211
00:13:27,860 --> 00:13:29,700
(Yu, Yuhua Palace)

212
00:13:38,340 --> 00:13:38,820
(Wanyao,)

213
00:13:40,340 --> 00:13:41,340
(where are you?)

214
00:13:43,900 --> 00:13:44,740
(The hunting grounds)

215
00:13:45,620 --> 00:13:47,300
(are the most dangerous place
right now.)

216
00:13:49,940 --> 00:13:50,900
(Every moment you stay)

217
00:13:52,940 --> 00:13:54,140
(puts you in greater danger.)

218
00:14:12,100 --> 00:14:12,500
Your Highness.

219
00:14:13,020 --> 00:14:14,100
When do we start looking for the deer?

220
00:14:16,300 --> 00:14:16,980
The real hunt

221
00:14:18,100 --> 00:14:19,820
begins after sunset.

222
00:14:32,140 --> 00:14:32,500
Your Highness.

223
00:14:32,940 --> 00:14:34,020
Zhi stopped up ahead.

224
00:14:34,620 --> 00:14:35,180
Meng Zaishi

225
00:14:35,620 --> 00:14:36,420
should be around here.

226
00:14:37,500 --> 00:14:37,900
Good.

227
00:15:09,620 --> 00:15:10,300
(It's the golden bell.)

228
00:15:11,380 --> 00:15:12,100
(The deer is nearby.)

229
00:15:13,860 --> 00:15:14,940
(Please,)

230
00:15:15,460 --> 00:15:16,580
(let Wanyao get there first.)

231
00:15:43,540 --> 00:15:44,340
The golden bell?

232
00:15:46,300 --> 00:15:47,300
Just a hundred paces away.

233
00:15:47,980 --> 00:15:49,060
Heaven's on my side.

234
00:15:50,980 --> 00:15:51,780
You stay here.

235
00:15:52,460 --> 00:15:54,420
Don't do anything to spook the prey.

236
00:15:54,660 --> 00:15:54,980
Yes.

237
00:15:54,980 --> 00:15:55,220
Yes.

238
00:16:09,220 --> 00:16:09,940
(The golden bell?)

239
00:16:10,860 --> 00:16:11,700
(But there's no deer at all.)

240
00:16:12,980 --> 00:16:13,660
(It's Wanyao.)

241
00:16:14,500 --> 00:16:15,500
(She's luring Meng Zaishi in.)

242
00:17:05,500 --> 00:17:06,660
Your Highness,

243
00:17:07,540 --> 00:17:08,700
it seems you heard the bell too.

244
00:17:11,820 --> 00:17:12,540
So

245
00:17:13,140 --> 00:17:14,260
who do you think wins tonight,

246
00:17:15,180 --> 00:17:16,460
you or me?

247
00:17:21,700 --> 00:17:22,300
General Meng.

248
00:17:23,260 --> 00:17:23,980
Is this

249
00:17:24,860 --> 00:17:25,700
what you meant?

250
00:18:05,700 --> 00:18:06,340
Stop shooting!

251
00:18:06,540 --> 00:18:07,540
Since you show no mercy,

252
00:18:08,340 --> 00:18:09,460
don't blame me for being ruthless.

253
00:18:21,180 --> 00:18:22,620
Mu Wanyao.

254
00:18:23,860 --> 00:18:25,820
All those bells and ambushes...

255
00:18:26,940 --> 00:18:27,940
After all that trouble,

256
00:18:28,780 --> 00:18:30,220
you still end up right where I want you.

257
00:18:33,140 --> 00:18:34,980
There's a saying from the Central Plains
I really like.

258
00:18:35,980 --> 00:18:37,500
"Raw power beats skill."

259
00:18:38,100 --> 00:18:38,940
Save your schemes

260
00:18:39,780 --> 00:18:41,780
for someone else.

261
00:19:19,740 --> 00:19:20,820
So that's how it is.

262
00:19:21,700 --> 00:19:23,980
You left me an escape route, set a trap,

263
00:19:24,980 --> 00:19:26,180
and waited for me to walk right in.

264
00:19:28,020 --> 00:19:28,780
Mu Wanyao.

265
00:19:30,700 --> 00:19:31,940
I couldn't outsmart you in the end.

266
00:19:34,420 --> 00:19:35,180
I don't care

267
00:19:35,620 --> 00:19:36,300
who kills the deer.

268
00:19:37,020 --> 00:19:38,380
As long as you die by my hand.

269
00:19:38,700 --> 00:19:40,340
Why can't you play fair with me?

270
00:19:41,540 --> 00:19:43,500
I always wanted you alive.

271
00:19:44,260 --> 00:19:45,980
But you've wanted me dead all along.

272
00:19:47,220 --> 00:19:48,500
You're so cruel to me.

273
00:19:50,940 --> 00:19:52,460
I saved your life

274
00:19:52,460 --> 00:19:53,380
in front of Meng Baiyu.

275
00:19:54,380 --> 00:19:55,380
I killed Meng Baiyu,

276
00:19:56,020 --> 00:19:57,700
but it was you who reaped the spoils.

277
00:19:58,540 --> 00:19:59,260
Fair?

278
00:20:00,020 --> 00:20:01,140
We've been even for a long time.

279
00:20:01,500 --> 00:20:02,860
Then why do you hate me so much?

280
00:20:03,340 --> 00:20:04,460
You brought this on yourself.

281
00:20:05,700 --> 00:20:07,020
If you'd stayed put in North Jing,

282
00:20:07,300 --> 00:20:08,260
we could've coexisted just fine.

283
00:20:09,140 --> 00:20:11,060
But you had to travel all the way
to Sheng'an

284
00:20:11,260 --> 00:20:12,180
to cut off my future.

285
00:20:13,020 --> 00:20:14,540
Then don't blame me
for sending you to your death.

286
00:20:14,780 --> 00:20:15,940
After all that,

287
00:20:16,900 --> 00:20:17,980
you're still blaming me for coming
to Sheng'an

288
00:20:18,500 --> 00:20:19,940
and ruining your little romance.

289
00:20:20,580 --> 00:20:22,540
You exposed my secrets
at the Qiuqian Banquet.

290
00:20:23,300 --> 00:20:25,340
Weren't you trying to get me killed
by public opinion?

291
00:20:27,260 --> 00:20:28,660
Knowing how you usually operate,

292
00:20:28,660 --> 00:20:30,420
I doubt you'd care
about something like that.

293
00:20:34,580 --> 00:20:35,420
If you ask me,

294
00:20:36,740 --> 00:20:37,940
you're just worried

295
00:20:37,940 --> 00:20:39,420
about your lover.

296
00:20:42,860 --> 00:20:44,580
If he minds
that you can't bear children...

297
00:20:45,380 --> 00:20:46,260
I don't mind.

298
00:20:46,500 --> 00:20:46,900
Shut it!

299
00:20:51,420 --> 00:20:52,420
Everything I've done

300
00:20:53,260 --> 00:20:54,620
since coming to Sheng'an

301
00:20:55,180 --> 00:20:56,940
has been out of love for you.

302
00:20:58,620 --> 00:20:59,340
In North Jing,

303
00:21:00,180 --> 00:21:02,140
when a man likes a girl,
he just throws her on his horse.

304
00:21:02,980 --> 00:21:04,300
That's just how it is.

305
00:21:04,980 --> 00:21:06,260
Even if she resists at first,

306
00:21:07,380 --> 00:21:09,180
she'll come around after a few days.

307
00:21:09,660 --> 00:21:10,820
You treated me like prey

308
00:21:11,260 --> 00:21:12,940
you could just throw on a horse.

309
00:21:13,260 --> 00:21:14,580
Then taste what it's like

310
00:21:15,260 --> 00:21:16,500
to be prey at someone else's mercy.

311
00:21:17,420 --> 00:21:18,020
Meng Zaishi,

312
00:21:18,580 --> 00:21:19,380
since that's what you think,

313
00:21:20,740 --> 00:21:21,740
then you deserve to die.

314
00:21:28,340 --> 00:21:28,940
No, Your Highness!

315
00:21:35,820 --> 00:21:36,380
Yan Shang?

316
00:21:37,260 --> 00:21:37,940
What are you doing?

317
00:21:39,060 --> 00:21:39,740
Thank god.

318
00:21:41,100 --> 00:21:41,500
Your Highness,

319
00:21:41,900 --> 00:21:43,180
now's not the time to kill.

320
00:21:43,540 --> 00:21:43,900
Go.

321
00:21:44,260 --> 00:21:45,220
Leave the hunting grounds now.

322
00:21:46,380 --> 00:21:47,060
What happened?

323
00:21:47,260 --> 00:21:48,740
Mu Xianqing
and the Eastern Circuit behind him

324
00:21:49,220 --> 00:21:50,020
have joined the Crown Prince.

325
00:21:50,260 --> 00:21:51,460
I saw them plotting.

326
00:21:51,940 --> 00:21:53,580
The fight for the throne
happens tonight, right here

327
00:21:54,180 --> 00:21:54,980
in the hunting grounds.

328
00:21:55,700 --> 00:21:57,180
No wonder
the Crown Prince's been wary of me.

329
00:21:58,260 --> 00:21:59,340
So he went to Mu Xianqing.

330
00:22:05,020 --> 00:22:06,500
They're trying to take down Yu tonight?

331
00:22:09,900 --> 00:22:11,420
No wonder Xun,
who's always so self-important,

332
00:22:12,460 --> 00:22:14,900
got involved in this hunting mess.

333
00:22:15,340 --> 00:22:15,860
Exactly.

334
00:22:16,260 --> 00:22:17,420
They think Yu Cheng'an's forces

335
00:22:17,420 --> 00:22:18,460
are thin in the hunting grounds,

336
00:22:18,700 --> 00:22:19,940
and it's worth the gamble.

337
00:22:28,900 --> 00:22:29,780
After tonight,

338
00:22:30,700 --> 00:22:32,060
Huai changes hands.

339
00:22:35,300 --> 00:22:36,980
Congratulations, Your Royal Highness.

340
00:22:37,500 --> 00:22:38,300
It's a bit early

341
00:22:38,940 --> 00:22:40,180
to say that.

342
00:22:40,940 --> 00:22:42,780
We wait for the moon to reach its peak.

343
00:22:43,820 --> 00:22:44,660
Once the Zi hour passes,

344
00:22:46,340 --> 00:22:47,020
Yang Si and I

345
00:22:47,860 --> 00:22:48,940
will strike
the temporary imperial palace

346
00:22:49,380 --> 00:22:50,180
as planned.

347
00:22:51,700 --> 00:22:52,700
If Yu Cheng'an catches on,

348
00:22:53,540 --> 00:22:54,820
he'll move to encircle the palace.

349
00:22:55,660 --> 00:22:56,060
That's when

350
00:22:56,620 --> 00:22:57,780
we'll need you to hold the rear,
General Mu.

351
00:23:00,500 --> 00:23:01,540
Your Royal Highness, don't worry.

352
00:23:02,260 --> 00:23:04,700
Taking down that eunuch
will be like shooting fish in a barrel.

353
00:23:06,060 --> 00:23:07,740
He won't get any reinforcements.

354
00:23:08,060 --> 00:23:10,860
I've long heard of your valor in battle.

355
00:23:11,580 --> 00:23:12,620
With you on my side,

356
00:23:13,420 --> 00:23:14,980
my strength is doubled.

357
00:23:15,460 --> 00:23:16,900
But killing him

358
00:23:17,580 --> 00:23:18,700
won't be so easy.

359
00:23:19,540 --> 00:23:21,380
I hear he has a man named Qiu Shuo.

360
00:23:23,220 --> 00:23:24,180
A real handful.

361
00:23:26,980 --> 00:23:27,820
Your Royal Highness,

362
00:23:28,620 --> 00:23:30,340
I'll risk my life with you.

363
00:23:30,900 --> 00:23:32,100
When it's done,

364
00:23:33,220 --> 00:23:35,100
surely you won't forget
the Eastern Circuit's contribution?

365
00:23:35,860 --> 00:23:36,420
Today,

366
00:23:37,260 --> 00:23:39,020
we've entrusted each other
with our lives.

367
00:23:40,220 --> 00:23:41,380
Once the Yu faction is wiped out,

368
00:23:42,060 --> 00:23:43,340
I'll give you

369
00:23:44,260 --> 00:23:44,780
whatever

370
00:23:45,420 --> 00:23:46,620
you want.

371
00:23:58,020 --> 00:23:59,060
By then,

372
00:24:00,300 --> 00:24:01,820
North Jing will finally be united.

373
00:24:02,620 --> 00:24:03,220
I'd

374
00:24:04,100 --> 00:24:05,140
be glad to see that.

375
00:24:11,740 --> 00:24:12,980
The Crown Prince took this risky step

376
00:24:13,380 --> 00:24:14,420
without even telling me.

377
00:24:15,660 --> 00:24:16,500
But it's come to this.

378
00:24:17,420 --> 00:24:19,060
I can only burn my boats and join him.

379
00:24:19,780 --> 00:24:20,460
Don't.

380
00:24:21,020 --> 00:24:22,060
Yu Cheng'an's been ready all along.

381
00:24:22,540 --> 00:24:24,100
He's been waiting for the prey
to walk into his trap.

382
00:24:25,820 --> 00:24:26,660
Absolutely true.

383
00:24:32,500 --> 00:24:33,060
Third-Place Scholar.

384
00:24:34,220 --> 00:24:37,460
Were you saying all that
just so I would hear it?

385
00:24:40,220 --> 00:24:41,420
You're dead tonight no matter what.

386
00:24:42,180 --> 00:24:42,900
Listen all you want.

387
00:24:43,940 --> 00:24:44,860
Wait, wait.

388
00:24:46,780 --> 00:24:48,260
Since it was meant for me,

389
00:24:49,980 --> 00:24:51,500
how about you hear me out first.

390
00:24:52,700 --> 00:24:54,300
Mu Xianqing allying
with the Crown Prince?

391
00:24:55,700 --> 00:24:57,020
I doubt that's for real.

392
00:24:58,660 --> 00:24:59,900
Tell us everything you know.

393
00:25:00,980 --> 00:25:02,500
The Central and the Eastern Circuits
have never gotten along.

394
00:25:03,380 --> 00:25:05,780
The Mengs and Mu Xianqing have been
at each other's throats for decades.

395
00:25:07,020 --> 00:25:08,060
We probably know

396
00:25:09,180 --> 00:25:10,460
Mu Xianqing's character better than you

397
00:25:11,380 --> 00:25:12,500
and the Crown Prince do.

398
00:25:13,260 --> 00:25:14,420
Remember Yuan Jia,
the Military Commander

399
00:25:15,060 --> 00:25:15,980
of the Western Circuit?

400
00:25:31,260 --> 00:25:31,660
Your Highness.

401
00:25:34,700 --> 00:25:36,780
He and Mu Xianqing have been allies
for decades.

402
00:25:37,260 --> 00:25:38,700
Always followed Mu Xianqing's lead.

403
00:25:39,700 --> 00:25:40,860
But you probably don't know

404
00:25:41,060 --> 00:25:42,620
how many times
Mu Xianqing has screwed him over.

405
00:25:43,780 --> 00:25:45,980
It's only because they share
a common enemy,

406
00:25:46,060 --> 00:25:47,140
the Central Circuit,

407
00:25:47,860 --> 00:25:49,460
that Yuan Jia had to swallow his pride.

408
00:25:50,620 --> 00:25:52,220
Mu Xianqing may look valorous,

409
00:25:52,540 --> 00:25:53,380
but he's vicious.

410
00:25:53,900 --> 00:25:54,900
And he's insanely greedy.

411
00:25:55,900 --> 00:25:57,540
He has no sense of honor.

412
00:25:58,740 --> 00:25:59,820
So I guarantee you,

413
00:26:01,140 --> 00:26:03,060
tonight with the Crown Prince,

414
00:26:03,740 --> 00:26:05,460
he'll turn on him at the last minute.

415
00:26:09,060 --> 00:26:11,740
Then the Crown Prince
will be fighting on two fronts tonight.

416
00:26:12,580 --> 00:26:13,820
If he storms
the temporary imperial palace

417
00:26:14,220 --> 00:26:15,900
and Mu Xianqing doesn't back him up,

418
00:26:16,460 --> 00:26:17,820
with the few men the Crown Prince has,

419
00:26:19,780 --> 00:26:21,420
he's as good as dead.

420
00:26:21,980 --> 00:26:23,540
Best case, he ends up a prisoner.

421
00:26:24,620 --> 00:26:25,660
Worst case, Yu Cheng'an

422
00:26:26,220 --> 00:26:26,820
finishes him off

423
00:26:27,660 --> 00:26:28,340
for good.

424
00:26:29,340 --> 00:26:30,380
Even if the Crown Prince pulls it off,

425
00:26:31,300 --> 00:26:33,860
after barely surviving Yu Cheng'an,

426
00:26:34,380 --> 00:26:35,420
his men will be exhausted.

427
00:26:35,740 --> 00:26:37,300
And he'll still have Mu Xianqing
breathing down his neck.

428
00:26:38,620 --> 00:26:39,060
Your Highness,

429
00:26:39,900 --> 00:26:41,540
Yu Cheng'an has allowed the Crown Prince

430
00:26:41,940 --> 00:26:43,060
and Mu Xianqing to join the hunt.

431
00:26:43,780 --> 00:26:44,740
He must have something planned.

432
00:26:45,860 --> 00:26:46,420
So

433
00:26:47,100 --> 00:26:49,100
Yu Cheng'an has already chosen
a new heir to the throne.

434
00:26:49,860 --> 00:26:51,660
By then,
with a new emperor under his thumb,

435
00:26:53,340 --> 00:26:54,500
my father will be expendable too.

436
00:26:54,860 --> 00:26:55,220
Right.

437
00:26:56,500 --> 00:26:57,060
Tonight,

438
00:26:57,540 --> 00:27:00,100
the Crown Prince and Yu Cheng'an are
still locked in battle with no winner.

439
00:27:00,540 --> 00:27:01,980
We need to get back
and save your father.

440
00:27:02,580 --> 00:27:03,100
We have to hurry.

441
00:27:03,900 --> 00:27:04,340
Let's go!

442
00:27:06,300 --> 00:27:06,740
Your Highness.

443
00:27:07,620 --> 00:27:08,660
I can't ride half as well as you.

444
00:27:08,820 --> 00:27:09,580
I can't keep up.

445
00:27:10,140 --> 00:27:11,540
There's no time to lose.

446
00:27:11,900 --> 00:27:12,900
Take Fang Tong and the others
and go ahead.

447
00:27:13,340 --> 00:27:14,620
I'll meet up with Wei Shu and the Zhaos,

448
00:27:14,740 --> 00:27:15,740
then join you at the palace.

449
00:27:18,180 --> 00:27:18,940
Be careful.

450
00:27:21,820 --> 00:27:22,620
Keep an eye on Meng Zaishi.

451
00:27:25,620 --> 00:27:26,100
Don't worry.

452
00:27:32,140 --> 00:27:33,900
Fang Tong, have two men
protect Yan Shang.

453
00:27:34,460 --> 00:27:35,260
Everyone else, follow me!

454
00:27:42,220 --> 00:27:42,740
Third-Place Scholar,

455
00:27:44,540 --> 00:27:45,340
right now,

456
00:27:46,100 --> 00:27:47,740
the most dangerous place
is the hunting grounds.

457
00:27:49,700 --> 00:27:50,900
You tricked her into going back, right?

458
00:27:53,220 --> 00:27:53,820
Yeah.

459
00:27:55,580 --> 00:27:58,780
Charge!

460
00:28:31,820 --> 00:28:34,260
Her Highness put your life in my hands.

461
00:28:36,500 --> 00:28:38,140
You seem pretty sure I won't kill you.

462
00:28:38,700 --> 00:28:40,500
She gave you the job of dealing with me,

463
00:28:42,020 --> 00:28:43,220
which proves you're a smart man.

464
00:28:44,020 --> 00:28:45,420
That's how things stand tonight.

465
00:28:46,220 --> 00:28:47,260
A smart man

466
00:28:48,100 --> 00:28:49,820
should know I can't be killed right now.

467
00:28:50,780 --> 00:28:51,860
Because I am

468
00:28:51,860 --> 00:28:53,300
the only wild card

469
00:28:54,020 --> 00:28:55,020
not in either side's plan.

470
00:28:56,180 --> 00:28:56,580
Yes.

471
00:28:57,700 --> 00:28:58,220
Long term,

472
00:28:58,820 --> 00:29:00,060
you command
the Central Circuit's troops.

473
00:29:00,860 --> 00:29:01,340
Short term,

474
00:29:02,300 --> 00:29:03,300
in these hunting grounds,

475
00:29:03,460 --> 00:29:05,420
apart from the Crown Prince
and Mu Xianqing,

476
00:29:06,180 --> 00:29:07,660
you brought the most men.

477
00:29:09,980 --> 00:29:10,700
You can't die.

478
00:29:13,300 --> 00:29:14,460
But have you thought about it?

479
00:29:16,340 --> 00:29:18,140
Whether it's Mu Xianqing or Yu Cheng'an,

480
00:29:18,780 --> 00:29:19,780
once they take down the Crown Prince,

481
00:29:19,780 --> 00:29:21,940
their next move is straight
for the palace.

482
00:29:22,620 --> 00:29:24,140
You tricked her into going back.

483
00:29:25,180 --> 00:29:27,580
Aren't you just letting her wait to die
with her old man?

484
00:29:28,860 --> 00:29:29,460
Then don't let them

485
00:29:30,260 --> 00:29:32,220
get to the next step, General Meng.

486
00:29:32,980 --> 00:29:34,780
Only then can Her Highness
truly be saved.

487
00:29:37,860 --> 00:29:38,340
Third-Place Scholar.

488
00:29:41,700 --> 00:29:43,060
Your name's Yan Shang, right?

489
00:29:44,500 --> 00:29:45,260
No time to waste.

490
00:29:45,900 --> 00:29:46,500
Come on up.

491
00:29:47,540 --> 00:29:48,860
First, tell me your terms.

492
00:29:51,100 --> 00:29:52,180
Whatever the terms,

493
00:29:52,900 --> 00:29:54,100
you'll help anyway.

494
00:30:21,940 --> 00:30:25,820
(Tranquility Brings Wisdom)

495
00:30:33,900 --> 00:30:38,180
(Wu, Wei, Shen, You, Xu, Hai)

496
00:30:45,980 --> 00:30:46,500
Mr. Chen.

497
00:30:47,180 --> 00:30:47,820
It's the Zi hour.

498
00:30:48,980 --> 00:30:49,700
Close the gate.

499
00:30:54,140 --> 00:30:54,740
Princess Danyang?

500
00:30:55,180 --> 00:30:56,300
Aren't you at the hunting grounds?

501
00:30:56,460 --> 00:30:57,460
Why are you back?

502
00:31:04,380 --> 00:31:04,980
Mr. Chen.

503
00:31:07,140 --> 00:31:08,060
I have urgent business

504
00:31:08,420 --> 00:31:09,260
with my father.

505
00:31:09,860 --> 00:31:10,660
Please let him know.

506
00:31:11,740 --> 00:31:12,940
His Majesty has already gone to bed.

507
00:31:13,180 --> 00:31:14,380
Come back tomorrow morning.

508
00:31:15,300 --> 00:31:16,780
Just tell my father
Princess Danyang is here.

509
00:31:17,380 --> 00:31:18,580
He won't blame me.

510
00:31:19,820 --> 00:31:21,060
His Majesty gave orders before bed

511
00:31:21,380 --> 00:31:22,860
that no one is to disturb him.

512
00:31:23,140 --> 00:31:24,500
I wouldn't dare disobey.

513
00:31:25,940 --> 00:31:26,940
I have good news.

514
00:31:28,220 --> 00:31:29,340
If I wait until tomorrow,

515
00:31:29,820 --> 00:31:31,100
I'm afraid my father will blame me

516
00:31:31,180 --> 00:31:32,260
for not telling him first.

517
00:31:36,420 --> 00:31:38,340
Then why not tell me?

518
00:31:38,620 --> 00:31:39,820
I'll pass it on for you?

519
00:31:40,940 --> 00:31:41,620
That won't do.

520
00:31:42,980 --> 00:31:43,900
I must tell my father

521
00:31:44,460 --> 00:31:45,820
this good news myself

522
00:31:46,100 --> 00:31:46,860
and make him happy.

523
00:31:48,940 --> 00:31:49,220
Well...

524
00:31:49,780 --> 00:31:50,140
Father!

525
00:31:50,140 --> 00:31:50,820
Your Highness.

526
00:31:50,820 --> 00:31:51,180
Father!

527
00:31:51,220 --> 00:31:51,900
Your Highness!

528
00:31:52,620 --> 00:31:53,860
Your Highness, there's nothing I can do.

529
00:31:54,180 --> 00:31:55,420
His Majesty has already gone to bed.

530
00:31:55,740 --> 00:31:57,060
Come back tomorrow morning.

531
00:31:59,260 --> 00:31:59,620
Never mind.

532
00:32:00,300 --> 00:32:01,260
Since he's asleep,

533
00:32:01,700 --> 00:32:02,580
I'll come back tomorrow.

534
00:32:09,500 --> 00:32:10,980
We'll be waiting to welcome you,
Your Highness!

535
00:32:17,260 --> 00:32:19,100
(Father never sleeps that soundly.)

536
00:32:19,380 --> 00:32:20,420
(Not a single cough.)

537
00:32:22,020 --> 00:32:22,980
(That's not him)

538
00:32:23,460 --> 00:32:24,620
(in that bed.)

539
00:32:26,340 --> 00:32:27,940
I do like Mu Wanyao.

540
00:32:29,380 --> 00:32:31,380
But I'm not about to go die for her.

541
00:32:32,180 --> 00:32:34,100
We both know
the Crown Prince is doomed tonight.

542
00:32:34,300 --> 00:32:35,020
It's already decided.

543
00:32:35,940 --> 00:32:38,100
You come dragging me in
when your backs were against the wall.

544
00:32:38,980 --> 00:32:40,140
Don't you think it's a bit late?

545
00:32:41,660 --> 00:32:42,700
I came to Sheng'an

546
00:32:43,060 --> 00:32:44,140
just to deliver a birthday gift

547
00:32:45,100 --> 00:32:45,660
and

548
00:32:46,340 --> 00:32:48,420
take back the woman the Emperor owes me.

549
00:32:49,700 --> 00:32:50,820
Now the waters are this muddy.

550
00:32:51,660 --> 00:32:52,460
None of my concern.

551
00:32:53,140 --> 00:32:54,220
I'd be more than happy to see

552
00:32:54,420 --> 00:32:55,380
all three sides lose.

553
00:32:58,220 --> 00:32:59,460
General Meng, have you ever heard

554
00:33:00,140 --> 00:33:01,620
that the game opens up where you cut?

555
00:33:02,740 --> 00:33:04,660
The Crown Prince,
Yu Cheng'an, and Mu Xianqing

556
00:33:04,980 --> 00:33:06,220
all have their own agendas.

557
00:33:06,940 --> 00:33:08,420
If no one else enters the game,

558
00:33:09,020 --> 00:33:10,860
one of the three will come out on top.

559
00:33:12,540 --> 00:33:13,180
What if

560
00:33:13,940 --> 00:33:15,500
Mu Xianqing wins?

561
00:33:18,980 --> 00:33:19,540
Military Governor,

562
00:33:20,300 --> 00:33:21,460
are we still holding position?

563
00:33:22,500 --> 00:33:22,860
No rush.

564
00:33:23,620 --> 00:33:24,300
Wait a little longer.

565
00:33:26,220 --> 00:33:27,420
Let the two fight.

566
00:33:27,540 --> 00:33:29,540
I want to see which one kills the other.

567
00:33:31,020 --> 00:33:32,700
Wait till one's dead and one's crippled,

568
00:33:33,940 --> 00:33:34,900
then we step in

569
00:33:35,380 --> 00:33:36,260
and take on whoever's left.

570
00:33:37,220 --> 00:33:37,820
That'll be much easier.

571
00:33:38,500 --> 00:33:39,020
You're right.

572
00:33:40,940 --> 00:33:42,500
Does the Crown Prince

573
00:33:43,060 --> 00:33:44,100
forget

574
00:33:45,860 --> 00:33:47,380
I'm a Mu too?

575
00:33:49,100 --> 00:33:50,860
Once he and the old man are both dead,

576
00:33:52,060 --> 00:33:54,820
I'll be the only one
with a legitimate claim

577
00:33:58,260 --> 00:33:59,180
to the throne.

578
00:34:02,860 --> 00:34:03,980
If you just stand by

579
00:34:04,620 --> 00:34:06,060
and let him reap the spoils,

580
00:34:06,660 --> 00:34:07,860
once he's got all the power,

581
00:34:08,540 --> 00:34:10,780
who's going to be his next target?

582
00:34:12,700 --> 00:34:14,340
Mu Xianqing won't let anyone
pose a threat

583
00:34:15,220 --> 00:34:16,700
to his Eastern Circuit.

584
00:34:21,260 --> 00:34:22,460
But you saw it yourself.

585
00:34:24,100 --> 00:34:26,180
A moment ago, Mu Wanyao wanted me dead.

586
00:34:27,420 --> 00:34:29,260
Now you want an alliance
with a few smooth words.

587
00:34:30,300 --> 00:34:30,980
Why should I trust you?

588
00:34:33,100 --> 00:34:33,740
Let me be blunt.

589
00:34:35,020 --> 00:34:36,740
I'm afraid you'll kill me
once I'm no longer useful.

590
00:34:39,100 --> 00:34:39,660
General Meng,

591
00:34:40,940 --> 00:34:42,340
can your grudge with the Princess

592
00:34:43,060 --> 00:34:45,420
really outweigh the crisis right now?

593
00:34:46,700 --> 00:34:47,460
After tonight,

594
00:34:47,780 --> 00:34:50,060
you'll be the hero who saved Huai

595
00:34:50,820 --> 00:34:52,860
and the man who saved
the Princess's father and brothers.

596
00:34:53,900 --> 00:34:55,180
The Princess is true to her feelings.

597
00:34:56,020 --> 00:34:58,260
She'll treat you differently.

598
00:35:04,380 --> 00:35:05,100
I'm afraid

599
00:35:05,980 --> 00:35:07,620
the Crown Prince has already made
his move.

600
00:35:08,700 --> 00:35:09,220
Guess

601
00:35:09,900 --> 00:35:12,020
whether the Crown Prince promised
Mu Xianqing

602
00:35:12,660 --> 00:35:14,620
your Central Circuit
as part of his reward.

603
00:35:27,900 --> 00:35:28,540
General Meng,

604
00:35:29,660 --> 00:35:31,260
whether we break this deadlock tonight

605
00:35:32,820 --> 00:35:34,100
hangs on your choice.

606
00:35:58,300 --> 00:35:59,340
Why haven't the Eastern Circuit men
shown up?

607
00:35:59,900 --> 00:36:01,060
Yu Cheng'an's main force isn't here.

608
00:36:01,460 --> 00:36:03,060
They must be tied up
with Mu Xianqing outside.

609
00:36:03,540 --> 00:36:04,460
We have to end this fast.

610
00:36:04,780 --> 00:36:06,460
We can't let him call in reinforcements.

611
00:36:07,100 --> 00:36:07,900
Then let's charge in

612
00:36:08,220 --> 00:36:09,140
and grab that traitor Yu!

613
00:36:14,860 --> 00:36:15,980
Who dares intrude?

614
00:36:16,380 --> 00:36:17,060
Yu Cheng'an.

615
00:36:18,100 --> 00:36:19,140
You are a eunuch,

616
00:36:19,620 --> 00:36:21,700
yet you abuse your power
and line your pockets.

617
00:36:22,540 --> 00:36:23,180
Do you plead guilty?

618
00:36:27,620 --> 00:36:28,300
So

619
00:36:28,780 --> 00:36:29,980
it's you, Your Royal Highness.

620
00:36:30,860 --> 00:36:31,860
Don't waste time stalling!

621
00:36:32,780 --> 00:36:33,580
Get out here!

622
00:36:34,860 --> 00:36:35,620
His Royal Highness is merciful.

623
00:36:36,100 --> 00:36:36,900
He'll grant you a clean death!

624
00:36:37,580 --> 00:36:38,100
I'd urge

625
00:36:38,660 --> 00:36:40,700
Your Royal Highness to turn back

626
00:36:41,260 --> 00:36:42,180
before it's too late.

627
00:36:43,780 --> 00:36:46,260
Don't make a fatal mistake.

628
00:36:47,180 --> 00:36:48,060
All troops, hear my command!

629
00:36:49,260 --> 00:36:50,660
Surround this chamber at once.

630
00:36:51,220 --> 00:36:51,940
Anyone who steps out

631
00:36:52,220 --> 00:36:52,660
dies!

632
00:37:09,580 --> 00:37:10,140
(Yu Cheng'an.)

633
00:37:10,780 --> 00:37:11,500
(What are you doing?)

634
00:37:35,100 --> 00:37:35,860
Father?

635
00:37:41,780 --> 00:37:42,700
Why is His Majesty here?

636
00:37:44,860 --> 00:37:45,460
Your Majesty, forgive us!

637
00:37:45,780 --> 00:37:46,540
We meant no offense!

638
00:37:53,260 --> 00:37:54,020
We walked into a trap.

639
00:37:54,700 --> 00:37:55,900
We can't risk making a move.

640
00:37:56,660 --> 00:37:57,580
A head-on fight won't work.

641
00:37:58,060 --> 00:37:58,380
Let's go.

642
00:38:27,860 --> 00:38:28,660
A subject

643
00:38:29,660 --> 00:38:30,380
killing his lord!

644
00:38:31,660 --> 00:38:32,540
A son

645
00:38:33,340 --> 00:38:34,220
killing his father!

646
00:38:35,540 --> 00:38:37,660
Such utter disregard for all order

647
00:38:38,540 --> 00:38:39,860
can't be forgiven!

648
00:38:40,580 --> 00:38:41,700
Your Royal Highness,

649
00:38:43,180 --> 00:38:45,260
do you plead guilty?

650
00:38:57,420 --> 00:38:58,860
Charge!

651
00:38:58,860 --> 00:39:02,340
Kill! Kill them!

652
00:39:02,340 --> 00:39:03,900
Kill!

653
00:39:14,860 --> 00:39:15,860
Why isn't Mu Xianqing here yet?

654
00:39:17,660 --> 00:39:18,380
He's not coming.

655
00:39:28,780 --> 00:39:29,580
Your Majesty.

656
00:39:31,460 --> 00:39:33,300
The Crown Prince pulled
a stunt like this.

657
00:39:33,580 --> 00:39:35,020
How do you explain it?

658
00:39:36,700 --> 00:39:38,500
How do you want to explain it?

659
00:39:42,380 --> 00:39:43,380
The Crown Prince

660
00:39:44,380 --> 00:39:45,540
led troops into the palace.

661
00:39:46,620 --> 00:39:49,100
He's clearly trying to force you
off the throne.

662
00:39:49,940 --> 00:39:52,980
Now all the court officials are
in the hunting grounds.

663
00:39:53,460 --> 00:39:54,340
We should

664
00:39:54,540 --> 00:39:56,500
have them all come and witness it.

665
00:39:58,260 --> 00:40:00,540
Now only one last thing remains.

666
00:40:01,540 --> 00:40:02,740
Your Majesty,

667
00:40:03,380 --> 00:40:05,820
please draft the decree
deposing the heir.

668
00:40:54,740 --> 00:40:55,300
Fight our way out!

669
00:40:55,500 --> 00:40:57,540
Charge!

670
00:41:01,740 --> 00:41:02,340
Cheng'an.

671
00:41:04,380 --> 00:41:07,020
Can you hear me out?

672
00:41:07,500 --> 00:41:07,860
Alright.

673
00:41:08,900 --> 00:41:10,460
I'm all ears.

674
00:41:12,300 --> 00:41:13,100
A puppet

675
00:41:13,540 --> 00:41:15,460
and the hand that pulls the strings

676
00:41:16,620 --> 00:41:18,780
need years to fall into step.

677
00:41:20,380 --> 00:41:21,820
Swap them rashly,

678
00:41:23,940 --> 00:41:25,300
and who knows
what trouble it might bring?

679
00:41:33,780 --> 00:41:34,620
The Crown Prince,

680
00:41:35,380 --> 00:41:35,740
Xun,

681
00:41:38,180 --> 00:41:39,580
born the eldest legitimate son,

682
00:41:41,260 --> 00:41:42,540
second only to the Emperor,

683
00:41:44,820 --> 00:41:46,300
yet walks the path of depravity,

684
00:41:46,820 --> 00:41:48,420
with no word of virtue to his name.

685
00:41:59,420 --> 00:42:00,100
You

686
00:42:01,260 --> 00:42:03,900
really mean to take this all the way?

687
00:42:06,900 --> 00:42:07,340
Your Majesty.

688
00:42:08,460 --> 00:42:10,380
It's fine if you won't write it.

689
00:42:12,220 --> 00:42:12,700
Zidu!

690
00:42:29,620 --> 00:42:32,820
I'd long assumed you were unwell.

691
00:42:35,700 --> 00:42:38,300
You shouldn't overtax your mind.

692
00:42:39,020 --> 00:42:39,340
So

693
00:42:40,140 --> 00:42:40,940
I

694
00:42:41,780 --> 00:42:42,500
had Mr. Wei

695
00:42:43,820 --> 00:42:44,740
draft one.

696
00:42:48,100 --> 00:42:49,140
What do you think, Your Majesty?

697
00:42:49,140 --> 00:42:51,420
(Crown Prince, Xun, born the eldest son,
second only to the Emperor,)

698
00:42:54,380 --> 00:42:56,420
(yet walks the path of depravity,
with no word of virtue to his name.)

699
00:43:09,580 --> 00:43:09,980
By

700
00:43:10,740 --> 00:43:11,900
His Majesty's decree,

701
00:43:13,420 --> 00:43:15,420
seize the rebel Mu Xun.

702
00:43:16,260 --> 00:43:17,820
Dead or alive!

703
00:43:48,580 --> 00:43:49,340
Your Royal Highness, go!

704
00:43:50,180 --> 00:43:50,820
Let's go together!

705
00:44:12,820 --> 00:44:13,180
Go!

706
00:44:28,300 --> 00:44:29,180
How are you hurt this badly?

707
00:44:30,220 --> 00:44:30,580
No.

708
00:44:31,100 --> 00:44:31,940
You won't get far like this.

709
00:44:33,540 --> 00:44:34,260
We need to find somewhere

710
00:44:34,540 --> 00:44:35,380
to stop the bleeding.

711
00:44:39,820 --> 00:44:40,420
Military Governor,

712
00:44:40,980 --> 00:44:42,300
the Crown Prince's personal guards
are all wiped out.

713
00:44:42,980 --> 00:44:45,020
Yu Cheng'an's men
fought the Crown Prince's guards.

714
00:44:45,540 --> 00:44:46,380
Three in ten were casualties

715
00:44:46,620 --> 00:44:47,700
He's not still foolish enough

716
00:44:48,340 --> 00:44:49,660
to wait for us to save him, is he?

717
00:44:50,140 --> 00:44:50,780
He'll be waiting in vain.

718
00:44:51,740 --> 00:44:53,060
Yu Cheng'an has no idea

719
00:44:54,820 --> 00:44:56,500
there's someone waiting to strike

720
00:44:57,540 --> 00:44:59,380
while he's busy watching his own prey.

721
00:45:04,980 --> 00:45:05,420
Move out.

722
00:45:06,020 --> 00:45:06,540
Surround the temporary imperial palace.

723
00:45:06,900 --> 00:45:07,220
Yes!

724
00:45:08,580 --> 00:45:09,860
You actually let him get away?

725
00:45:13,180 --> 00:45:13,700
Pass my order.

726
00:45:14,500 --> 00:45:15,820
Have Qiu Shuo lead the pursuit.

727
00:45:16,420 --> 00:45:16,940
Once found,

728
00:45:17,300 --> 00:45:18,020
kill on sight!

729
00:45:18,580 --> 00:45:18,900
Yes!

730
00:45:24,100 --> 00:45:24,860
Sir, calm down.

731
00:45:25,420 --> 00:45:26,940
Whether the Crown Prince lives or dies,

732
00:45:27,260 --> 00:45:28,060
after tonight,

733
00:45:28,420 --> 00:45:30,020
he's no longer the heir.

734
00:45:30,820 --> 00:45:31,780
A new heir

735
00:45:32,180 --> 00:45:33,580
is about to be named.

736
00:45:35,500 --> 00:45:36,380
It's going to be a long night.

737
00:45:37,180 --> 00:45:38,420
Let's hope dawn

738
00:45:38,820 --> 00:45:39,700
brings

739
00:45:40,340 --> 00:45:41,260
everything we wish for.

740
00:45:42,900 --> 00:45:43,220
Oh, right,

741
00:45:43,740 --> 00:45:44,900
bring that woman in.

742
00:45:45,540 --> 00:45:45,860
Yes.

743
00:46:15,540 --> 00:46:20,300
(Next Episode Preview)

744
00:46:24,620 --> 00:46:25,420
Someone!

745
00:46:32,860 --> 00:46:33,340
Father.

746
00:46:37,161 --> 00:46:40,454
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

747
00:46:43,139 --> 00:46:48,055
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

748
00:46:50,249 --> 00:46:56,094
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

749
00:46:56,594 --> 00:47:01,820
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

750
00:47:04,589 --> 00:47:09,380
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

751
00:47:10,216 --> 00:47:16,295
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

752
00:47:18,096 --> 00:47:21,246
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

753
00:47:21,246 --> 00:47:22,894
♪Burning bright as a song♪

754
00:47:22,946 --> 00:47:26,670
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

755
00:47:27,048 --> 00:47:31,714
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

756
00:47:32,333 --> 00:47:36,374
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

757
00:47:36,865 --> 00:47:38,980
♪Not a single hour less♪

758
00:47:39,020 --> 00:47:45,966
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

759
00:47:46,729 --> 00:47:50,182
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

760
00:47:50,362 --> 00:47:53,507
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

761
00:47:53,946 --> 00:48:00,583
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

762
00:48:00,980 --> 00:48:03,018
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

763
00:48:03,018 --> 00:48:05,494
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

764
00:48:05,532 --> 00:48:08,001
♪You're the only one I need♪

765
00:48:08,205 --> 00:48:15,092
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

766
00:48:15,404 --> 00:48:18,675
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

767
00:48:18,980 --> 00:48:22,153
♪My last untouched innocence♪

768
00:48:22,477 --> 00:48:25,903
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

769
00:48:26,136 --> 00:48:29,361
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

770
00:48:29,692 --> 00:48:36,488
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

771
00:48:36,857 --> 00:48:38,919
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

772
00:48:38,920 --> 00:48:41,423
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

773
00:48:41,470 --> 00:48:43,808
♪You're the only one I need♪

774
00:48:44,039 --> 00:48:50,874
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

775
00:48:51,223 --> 00:48:52,841
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

776
00:48:52,971 --> 00:48:54,767
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

777
00:48:55,124 --> 00:48:58,141
♪You're the only one I need♪

778
00:48:58,181 --> 00:48:59,508
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

